# Implementation plan — Spec 1.13.5

## Summary

Enable **company owners** to **Add** Data catalog items on all six entities. Owner creates always store status **`pending`** (UI: **Unverified**). Only **super admin** can **Verify**. Expose **`referenceCount`** on list/detail for usage visibility.

See [02-company-owner-create.md](./02-company-owner-create.md), [03-super-admin-verify.md](./03-super-admin-verify.md), [04-reference-counts.md](./04-reference-counts.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.13.5` |
| Prerequisite | Data catalog CRUD (1.11.0); company_admin Data nav (1.12.3) |
| Services | Data FE + BE |
| New env | None |
| WebOnOne / Identity code | None required |

---

## Phase 1 — Backend create + status rules

**Goal:** Company admin POST all entities; forced `pending`.

**Exit criteria:** Spoofed `status: verified` from company_admin still saves `pending`.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Widen POST middleware | `data/backend/src/routes/units.routes.ts`, `attributes.routes.ts`, `catalog.routes.ts` |
| Force status in create | `tags.service.ts`, `units.service.ts`, `attributes.service.ts`, `catalog.service.ts` (pass role from controller) |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w data-root`

---

## Phase 2 — Frontend Add + owner create UX

**Goal:** Add button for company_admin; status locked Unverified.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| `canCreate` vs `canMutate` | `TagsPage`, `UnitsPage`, `AttributesPage`, `CatalogListPage`, Tag picker |
| Forms | Tag/Unit/Attribute/Catalog form dialogs — hide status for company_admin |

---

## Phase 3 — Verify + Unverified labels

**Goal:** SA Verify; badge/filter say Unverified.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Badge / filters / dashboard | `StatusBadge.tsx`, list filter selects, `DashboardPage` |
| Verify menu | Entity list row menus (SA only) |

---

## Phase 4 — referenceCount

**Goal:** Count helpers + DTO + list UI.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Count helpers + list/get mapping | `data/backend/src/services/*` |
| FE types + row UI | `data.types.ts`, `*List.tsx`, `CatalogList.tsx` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w data-root`

---

## Forbidden

- Allowing `company_admin` to PATCH/PUT/DELETE catalog rows
- Allowing `company_admin` to persist `verified`
- Renaming DB ENUM `pending` → `unverified` in this release
- Adding `company_id` partition columns
- Counting references outside Data DB
- Changing Identity JWT claims

## Final verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w data-root
```

Manual: company owner Add × 6 → Unverified + Refs 0 → SA Verify → Verified; link tag to product → tag Refs ≥ 1.
